Mixed-polarity unit excluded from metric calculations: FIN_01 neutral unit_id=6 facts=["adverse_material_fact_1:A", "favorable_fact_3:F"] text="With an expense ratio of 1.45% and a diversified portfolio across 140 securities in 9 sectors, the fund offers broad exposure but at a moderate cost."
