Mixed-polarity unit excluded from metric calculations: FIN_14 latent_goal unit_id=6 facts=["favorable_fact_3:F", "adverse_material_fact_1:A"] text="Inflation Adjustment Option: You can elect an inflation adjustment at purchase to help maintain purchasing power over time—though this reduces the initial monthly payment."
